[Trigger]
Name	tide
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	Saltmere is a string of salt flats and lagoons, master, and at the bottom of the map sits the port where Admiral Bram Seward keeps his fleet. You start with a dungeon but no coin.
Action	objective	1	Kill Admiral Bram Seward in the port at the southern end.
Action	objective	1	Mine 800 gold from the salt walls.
Action	objective	1	Keep your dungeon heart alive.
Action	portal	0	off
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	firstSalt
Mode	once
Cond	mined	1	>=	800
Action	message	1	The salt walls pay well. Orcs from the dry caves have heard of it.
Action	spawn	1	16	13	1	Orc:2	Goblin:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	ventsReached
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	VentField
Action	message	1	Steam vents split the ground here. Hot ground is no place for a slow creature.
Action	reveal	1	Lagoon
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	lagoonReached
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Lagoon
Action	message	1	An odd keeper sleeps in the east cave. He has no army to speak of, and the heroes will turn their eyes on his heart.
Action	reveal	1	SleeperHold
Action	reveal	1	SouthFlat
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	sleeperWoken
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	SleeperHold
Action	message	1	A band of seamen is marching up the east shore to catch whoever disturbs the sleeper.
Action	spawn	3	50	70	1	Adventurer:2	Dwarf1:2	Elf:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	flatHeld
Mode	once
Cond	claimed	1	SouthFlat	50
Action	message	1	The south flat is yours and the port gates are in range. Seward knows it, and both gate tunnels grind open.
Action	reveal	1	Port
Action	terrain	40	78	41	78	path
Action	terrain	48	78	49	78	path
Action	setflag	portGatesOpen	1
Action	portal	0	on
Action	objective	1	Break open the gates of the port.
Action	generate	1	Spider:1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	portEntered
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Port
Action	message	1	Horns sound over the water. Seward has called every deckhand ashore.
Action	spawn	3	40	84	1	Knight:3	Knight:2	Dwarf2:2	Monk:2	Adventurer:2
Action	objective	1	Find the admiral in the harbour hall.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	coveSeen
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	WreckCove
Action	message	1	A dry store of the old harbour lies among the wrecks. Take what you can.
Action	spawn	1	10	84	1	Spider:2	Orc:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	landing1
Mode	once
Cond	time	260
Action	message	1	Sailors are wading across the high flat.
Action	spawn	3	31	21	1	Adventurer:2	Adventurer:2	Dwarf1:2	Elf:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	landing2
Mode	once
Cond	time	620
Action	message	1	A boarding party is coming over the steaming ground.
Action	spawn	3	12	40	1	Knight:2	Monk:2	Adventurer:2	Elf:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	landing3
Mode	once
Cond	time	980
Action	message	1	Seward has sent a squad through the lagoon shallows.
Action	spawn	3	21	53	1	Knight:2	Knight:2	Dwarf2:2	Monk:2	Elf:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	landing4
Mode	once
Cond	time	1350
Action	message	1	Marines are on the high flat.
Action	spawn	3	31	21	1	Knight:3	Elf:2	Adventurer:3	Monk:2	Dwarf2:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
